<tr><td class="style_td" style="text-align:center;"><span style="color:#3366ff">魔术师</span></td><td class="style_td">卢卡·佩尔萨基斯</td><td class="style_td">　</td><td class="style_td" style="text-align:center;">吊人</td><td class="style_td">战部时贞(臨時)</td><td class="style_td"><span style="color:#c0c0c0">别称使徒</span></td></tr>
