<tr><td class="style_td" style="text-align:center;"><span style="color:#339966">女帝</span></td><td class="style_td">　</td><td class="style_td">　</td><td class="style_td" style="text-align:center;"><span style="color:#3366ff">节制</span></td><td class="style_td">克拉丽丝·梅尔库里</td><td class="style_td">异色：电脑魔女克拉莉丝</td></tr>
